00:24:44.917 --> 00:24:47.820
...that had so much hate in it?

00:24:47.820 --> 00:24:51.056
How many times will I go in circles...

00:24:51.690 --> 00:24:53.359
...before I understand
what weakness is?

00:24:53.359 --> 00:24:56.128
I'm struggling and crying again,

00:24:56.128 --> 00:24:59.264
but that doesn't mean
I can't keep going!

00:25:00.099 --> 00:25:02.301
To the future ahead of us

00:25:11.677 --> 00:25:14.146
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:15.247 --> 00:25:17.649
If this keeps up,
I'll totally turn into a panda!

00:25:17.649 --> 00:25:20.085
Don't worry! I'll defeat Rice for sure!

00:25:20.085 --> 00:25:22.821
Leave the wiggin' showdown
to me! I'll put him to shame!

00:25:22.821 --> 00:25:24.890
You two are so dependable!

00:25:24.890 --> 00:25:26.725
Hey! I'm the king!

00:25:26.725 --> 00:25:28.127
No, I am!

00:25:28.127 --> 00:25:29.428
Wanna fight?

00:25:30.162 --> 00:25:31.997
Now's not the time to be fighting!

00:25:31.997 --> 00:25:33.432
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:33.432 --> 00:25:33.565
Bo-bobo & Rice's 30-Minute Cooking!
Ma'am, How Do You Like Tonight's Menu?

00:25:33.565 --> 00:25:37.536
Bo-bobo & Rice's 30-Minute Cooking! Ma'am, How Do You Like Tonight's Menu?
Bo-bobo & Rice"s 30-Minute Cooking! Ma'am, How Do You Like Tonight's Menu?

00:25:37.803 --> 00:25:39.638
Who will take the seat of king?

00:25:42.041 --> 00:25:44.943
Here's the results of the
Janken Fortune Teller, nah-na-la!

00:25:45.477 --> 00:25:50.516
If you won, all your plans will go without
a hitch if you eat sweet-and-sour pork!

00:25:51.350 --> 00:25:54.286
If you tied or lost, be sure
you enjoy your meals!
